	// (memql#1270, epic memql#1259 decision #4). An owner/admin operator
	// sends this to a target node to put it into maintenance/Draining on
	// demand, running the EXACT same graceful-drain sequence the deploy
	// SIGTERM path runs (memql#1269) -- Draining advertised in gossip +
	// readiness 503, in-flight drained within the grace period, then
	// Stopped + the Stop sweep. Owner/admin-gated; a non-owner/admin
